WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:06.660
Long before humanity colonises Mars our
children will live in floating nations

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:14.929
on the sea. Calcium carbonate will be
harvested directly from sea water,

00:00:14.929 --> 00:00:21.260
creating sea shell cities grown
organically using 3d printed biorock.

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:27.810
The aquatic generation will live in
upside-down skyscrapers, seascrapers,

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:33.780
where tremendous weight will hang deep
below the sea securing such stability

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:39.690
that neighborhoods will be raised on
pillars high above the waves. Simply by

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:44.640
reaching a depth of a thousand meters,
seascrapers will produce a super

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:49.320
abundance of electricity through the
magic of ocean thermal energy conversion.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:57.539
A proven green technology that uses the
ocean as a solar panel. At 500 meters a

00:00:57.539 --> 00:01:02.430
rich concentration of nutrients is
suspended in seawater where sunlight

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:08.790
can't reach. Seascrapers will draw this
elixir to the surface to spark a riot of

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:16.439
photosynthesis. Ocean gardens will sprout
in a fountain of life. Vast seaweed farms

00:01:16.439 --> 00:01:23.549
will absorb megatons of carbonic acid
reducing ocean acidity to feed the world

00:01:23.549 --> 00:01:29.820
with environmentally restorative food. The first to seek jobs on ocean farms

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:35.460
will be the poorest billion on Earth. They will come to the blue frontier

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:41.780
because floating societies will require
refugees to survive economically.

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:47.220
Imagine if Venice were a floating jigsaw
puzzle where each island could be

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:54.000
piloted independently. Mobile land will
empower individuals to exit poorly

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.000
governed societies and choose better
ones.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:05.130
Each floating homestead will be a nano-nation a seastead. Humanity is emerging

00:02:05.130 --> 00:02:10.100
from our land-based slumber and
awakening to the seastead century.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:15.810
Seasteading will restore the environment, 
enrich the poor and liberate humanity

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:22.260
from politicians. The seas cannot support
a state but fluid interaction will

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:28.080
incentivise civil society. More than
two-thirds of the Earth's surface waits

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:32.610
to be discovered,
then Homo aquaticus will explore the

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:37.180
depths beneath. Oceans first, the stars
next.

